Default authority to "localhost" and path to "/" for HTTP/HTTPS requests.

When a guest creates an outgoing HTTP request without setting authority or
path_with_query, the URI builder fails because HTTP/HTTPS URIs require an
authority component. This is not a regression — it has been this way since
the initial p3 implementation — but it is inconsistent with
default_send_request(), which already defaults path_with_query to "/".

